@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy";
}
<div class="mx-auto" style="max-width: 42rem">
    <h1 class="h2 mb-3">Privacy</h1>
    <p>ArrowOut stores your e-mail address, an optional display name, your theme choice and your level progress.</p>
    <p>
        If the operator enables analytics, anonymous gameplay events (for example "level completed") are sent to an external
        analytics service. Events carry a one-way hash instead of your account id or e-mail address.
    </p>
    <p>The leaderboard shows your display name, or a masked fragment of your user name if you have not set one.</p>
    <p>You can download or delete your personal data from the <a asp-area="Identity" asp-page="/Account/Manage/PersonalData">account page</a>.</p>
</div>
